# product-team-ai-kit agent registry: the single list of what each agent harness gets.
#
# Format (one entry per line, "|"-separated so paths may contain spaces):
#   <who>|<mode>|<source>|<target>
#
#   who     an agent name (what users pass to --agent), or a @group shared by agents
#   mode    about       one-line description shown by --list (source = text, target = -)
#           use         include every entry of group <source> (target = -)
#           file        copy one file
#           dir         copy every file under a directory (recursively, .gitkeep skipped)
#           block-md    write <source> into a managed <!-- --> block inside <target>
#           block-hash  write <source> into a managed # block inside <target>
#           mdc         write a Cursor .mdc rule: kit/cursor-rule-header.mdc + <source>
#   source  path relative to the repo root (the installed content dir)
#   target  path relative to the project dir (--dir)
#
# Sources are the repo's existing, reviewed harness layers: nothing is rewritten.
# `sh scripts/check.sh` fails CI if a source is missing, a target is unsafe, two
# entries fight over one target, or a guide in prompts/ is not listed in @guides.

# ---- shared groups ---------------------------------------------------------
@guides|file|prompts/Claude_Code_Workflow.md|prompts/Claude_Code_Workflow.md
@guides|file|prompts/Orchestrator.md|prompts/Orchestrator.md
@guides|file|prompts/Shared_Standards.md|prompts/Shared_Standards.md
@guides|file|prompts/Handoff_Schema.md|prompts/Handoff_Schema.md
@guides|file|prompts/Document_Summarizer.md|prompts/Document_Summarizer.md
@guides|file|prompts/LLM_Workflow_Checklist.md|prompts/LLM_Workflow_Checklist.md
@guides|file|prompts/Deep_Research_Agent.md|prompts/Deep_Research_Agent.md
@guides|file|prompts/AI_Framing_Agent.md|prompts/AI_Framing_Agent.md
@guides|file|prompts/AI_Framing_Template.md|prompts/AI_Framing_Template.md
@guides|file|prompts/PRFAQ_Guide.md|prompts/PRFAQ_Guide.md
@guides|file|prompts/PRD_Creation_Guide.md|prompts/PRD_Creation_Guide.md
@guides|file|prompts/Prototype_Spec_Guide.md|prompts/Prototype_Spec_Guide.md
@guides|file|prompts/Prototype_Creation_Guide.md|prompts/Prototype_Creation_Guide.md
@guides|file|prompts/ProjectDashboard_Template.html|prompts/ProjectDashboard_Template.html
@guides|file|prompts/ScreenIndex_Template.html|prompts/ScreenIndex_Template.html

@gitignore|block-hash|kit/gitignore|.gitignore

# Only with --include-samples.
@samples|dir|samples|samples
@samples|file|prompts/Sample_ClickablePrototype_AnyCompanyLearning.html|prompts/Sample_ClickablePrototype_AnyCompanyLearning.html
@samples|file|prompts/Sample_Screen_Dashboard.html|prompts/Sample_Screen_Dashboard.html

